course: dictionary
lesson: 7596
title: Primates: a group of animals
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A word can name a whole group of animals. «Lemurs are primates, cousins of monkeys and apes.» This tells you that lemurs, monkeys and apes all belong to one group, and that group is called primates.
explain: Look for clues around the word. Lemurs, monkeys and apes are all in the group, so primates must be the name for that family. Humans are primates too, so you are one as well.
explain: The same word can mean something different in another subject. In church lessons, a primate is a very senior bishop. In science, when you talk about animals, a primate is a mammal with flexible hands, forward-facing eyes and a big brain.
fact: A primate is a mammal in the group that includes humans, apes, monkeys and lemurs.
fact: Primates usually have hands that can grasp, eyes that face forwards, and big brains.
fact: «Bushbabies» are small African primates that leap several metres in the dark.
fact: «Tarsiers» are the only primates that eat only animals, such as insects, spiders and small lizards.
fact: Non-human primates include gorillas, chimpanzees, orangutans, gibbons, monkeys and lemurs.
exercise: «Lemurs are primates, cousins of monkeys and apes.» What is a primate? | A plant that grows in dark forests | *A member of the animal group that includes lemurs, monkeys, apes and humans | A kind of fish that lives in rivers | A type of rock found on mountains
exercise: «Tarsiers are the only primates that eat only animals.» Which food would a tarsier eat? | Fruit and seeds | Grass and leaves | *Insects, spiders and small lizards | Bread and cheese
exercise: «Mouse lemurs are among the smallest primates.» Find and copy the word that tells you what kind of animal a mouse lemur is. | smallest | mouse | *primates | among
test: Which of these animals is a primate? | A dolphin | A snake | *A gorilla | A crocodile
test: «Mouse lemurs have big eyes that help them hunt at night.» What do the big eyes help them do? | Swim faster | Read signs | *Hunt at night | Sing loudly
exam: Which group of animals does the word primate name? | Reptiles | Birds | Fish | *Mammals
